times if I didn't. And for a while we collected
the devices and then they got really smart

00:34:26.710 --> 00:34:31.630
and they were hiding them. So now you can
hide your iPod as much as you want but the

00:34:31.630 --> 00:34:33.740
Wifi is off or it's on for certain hours.

00:34:33.740 --> 00:34:35.710
And they have phones with 4G?

00:34:35.710 --> 00:34:41.200
Well so there's that right. So you need to
look at. You need to look at all the different

